# motion-video-first (M10): the first paint at real speed. The script runs on the real clock and
# records from the first frame: the grid fading in, the curve drawing on, P and its label arriving
# (FV 05 › Draw-on timeline, 2.6 s), then the page at rest. Judged in WebKit's recording (plan call
# 15: Chromium's software WebGL can't time anything), Firefox's as a second opinion.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
video start first-paint
wait 3000
video stop
